</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Yes</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">906 (69.4)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">612 (58.8)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1,518 (64.6)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.59 (1.01-2.39)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.16 (0.69-1.93)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="col" colspan="6" rowspan="1"><bold>Contraception use at conception<xref rid="T3FN5" ref-type="table-fn">e</xref> (n = 266)</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">417 (58.5)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">430 (60.1)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">847 (59.3)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.00</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.00</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Yes</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">295 (41.5)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">286 (39.9)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">581 (40.7)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.07 (0.67-1.71)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.28 (0.61-2.70)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="col" colspan="6" rowspan="1"><bold>Contraception at first sexual intercourse (n = 447)</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1,030 (74.3)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">567 (55.0)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1,597 (66.0)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.00</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.00</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Yes</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">357 (25.7)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">464 (45.0)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">821(34.0)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" col